  { layer: 'Product', t: 'A craft ledger for memo writing.', d: 'Stable finding IDs, an evidence line each, a “not yet distilled” tier, an append-only run log, an index checked in tests.', from: 'From EXAM_CRAFT.md and its index check.', size: 'M' },
