            <p>This is a <strong>collaboration study</strong>: one friend's codebase beside ours, read both ways, as described in the exploration <a href={EXPLORATION_URL}>Explore Collaborator Codebases for Insights: Comparative Highlights</a>, including its section "Two harnesses, not one". It ran in three steps.</p>
            <ol class="steps">
              <li><strong>Harness evidence.</strong> An inventory of every sign of how {THEM} works with coding agents, read at one commit (last commit 2026-10-01; about 280 commits, 251 tracked files), each artifact tagged dev, product or both.</li>
